<h1>Import Events from GetInvolved</h1>

<p>
  Upload a <code>.csv</code> or <code>.xlsx</code> file exported from GetInvolved.
  Valid events can be imported regardless of their GetInvolved status, including
  <strong>Approved</strong>, <strong>Submitted</strong>, and <strong>Initiated</strong>.
  Review and select events in the preview before confirming. Nothing is saved until you confirm.
</p>

<%= form_with url: event_imports_path, method: :post, multipart: true do |f| %>
  <%= f.file_field :file, accept: ".csv,.xlsx,text/csv,application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet" %>
  <%= f.submit "Upload and preview" %>
<% end %>

<%= link_to "Back to events", events_path %>
